oken-strategy.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cost-floor challenger, not a launch choice; retention terms unchecked."}, {"id": "docs_kickoff_13_llm_and_token_strategy_provider_adapter", "label": "Thin provider adapter", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kickoff/13-llm-and-token-strategy.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_kickoff_13_llm_and_token_strategy_architecture_lever", "label": "Architecture is the main cost lever, not the model", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kickoff/13-llm-and-token-strategy.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Templates, small pre-formatted tool results, cached prefix give about US$0.66/restaurant/month; naive design about 20x more."}, {"id": "docs_kickoff_13_llm_and_token_strategy_numbers_never_llm", "label": "Numbers never come from the model", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kickoff/13-llm-and-token-strategy.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tool results carry pre-formatted strings; code fills placeholders; post-check rejects numbers not in tool output; main answer to owner-trust risk."}, {"id": "docs_kickoff_13_llm_and_token_strategy_prompt_caching", "label": "Prompt caching with tenant-agnostic prefix", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/kickoff/13-llm-and-token-strategy.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Identical prefix across tenants; min cacheable 512 tokens on Haiku/Sonnet 5.5; tenant and date in tail message (ProjectDiscovery hit rate 7.6% to 73.7%)."}, {"id": "docs_kickoff_13_llm_and_token_strategy_thin_broker", "label": "Thin broker agent plus validat